---
import SectionTile from "./SectionTile.astro";
---

<SectionTile
  id="about"
  code="SEC-01 // ABOUT_PROFILE"
  title="TENTANG SAYA"
  subtitle="Profil profesional, latar belakang akademik, dan perpaduan disiplin rekayasa perangkat lunak, jaringan, & keselamatan kerja."
  accent="yellow"
>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <!-- Left: Deep Bio & Philosophy -->
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="brutal-card about-card">
        <div class="card-tag-badge">
          <span class="mono">SUMMARY // PROFILE_STATEMENT</span>
        </div>
        <p class="about-lead">
          Lulusan <strong>Sarjana Teknologi Informasi</strong> (Universitas Darma Persada, 2025, <strong>IPK 3.34/4.00</strong>) dengan pengalaman langsung membangun aplikasi web dan mobile full-stack menggunakan <strong>Python, PHP, JavaScript, React.js, dan Laravel</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="about-body">
          Keahlian software engineering saya diperkuat dengan sertifikasi jaringan <strong>Cisco CCNAv7: Introduction to Networks</strong> dan <strong>Cisco IT Essentials</strong>, memberikan pemahaman holistik mulai dari lapisan kode, database, hingga komunikasi protokol jaringan dan keamanan infrastruktur.
        </p>
        <p class="about-body">
          Selain kompetensi teknis, saya memiliki rekam jejak kepemimpinan nyata di masyarakat dan organisasi: memimpin komunitas roda dua skala regional, mengoordinasikan operasional pelabelan data AI di <strong>KUPU ID</strong>, dan mengabdi sebagai <strong>Sekretaris RT 005/RW 002 Klender</strong> sejak 2017. Saya juga tersertifikasi dalam disiplin <strong>Kesehatan & Keselamatan Kerja (K3)</strong> mencakup Job Safety Analysis, Fire Safety, dan First Aid.
        </p>

        <!-- 4 Core Pillars Grid -->
        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">💻</div>
            <div class="pillar-info">
              <h4 class="pillar-title">Full-Stack Dev</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">PHP/Laravel, React.js, Python, REST API, & MySQL</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">🌐</div>
            <div class="pillar-info">
              <h4 class="pillar-title">Networking</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">Cisco CCNAv7, IT Essentials, Subnetting & Routing</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">🤖</div>
            <div class="pillar-info">
              <h4 class="pillar-title">AI & Annotation</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">Dataset QA, Computer Vision & Machine Learning</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">🦺</div>
            <div class="pillar-info">
              <h4 class="pillar-title">K3 & Leadership</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">JSA, Fire Safety, First Aid, & Manajemen Komunitas</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Profile Specification Sheet -->
    <div class="about-specs">
      <div class="brutal-card specs-card">
        <div class="specs-header">
          <span class="mono header-code">&gt; SYSTEM SPECIFICATION SHEET</span>
          <span class="tag tag-yellow">VERIFIED</span>
        </div>

        <div class="specs-table mono">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">NAMA LENGKAP</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Dhio Andreas Gemilang</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">GELAR AKADEMIK</span>
            <span class="spec-value">S.Kom / S-1 Teknologi Informasi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">KAMPUS</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Universitas Darma Persada (2021-2025)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">IPK KUMULATIF</span>
            <span class="spec-value highlight-val">3.34 / 4.00 (Sangat Memuaskan)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">PENDIDIKAN AWAL</span>
            <span class="spec-value">SMKN 5 Jakarta (Audio Video, 2015-2018)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">LOKASI DOMISILI</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Klender, Duren Sawit, Jakarta Timur</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">LISENSI BERKENDARA</span>
            <span class="spec-value">SIM C (Aktif)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">KETERSEDIAAN</span>
            <span class="spec-value text-green">● Siap Bekerja (Full-Time / On-site / Remote)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="specs-footer">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">
            <span>Kirim Pesan Langsung ✉</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionTile>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr;
    }
  }

  .about-card {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-tag-badge {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--circuit-blue);
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about-body {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #333333;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 2px dashed rgba(16, 16, 16, 0.2);
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background: #F6F6F8;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 0.35rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-family: var(--font-subhead);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #555555;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  /* Specs Card */
  .specs-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .specs-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .header-code {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .specs-table {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .spec-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(16, 16, 16, 0.15);
  }

  .spec-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #777777;
  }

  .spec-value {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .highlight-val {
    background: var(--signal-yellow);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .text-green {
    color: #059669;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .specs-footer {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
</style>
